sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Provider
  participant App
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant RP as Razorpay
  P->>App: Choose plan
  App->>API: POST /subscriptions/checkout (idempotency key)
  API->>API: Check approved, no active subscription
  API->>RP: Create subscription
  API->>DB: subscription = pending
  API-->>App: Checkout details
  App->>RP: Complete payment
  App-->>P: "Confirming payment"
  RP->>API: Signed webhook
  API->>API: Verify signature on raw body
  API->>DB: Insert event ID (unique)
  alt New event
    API->>DB: Transaction: payment, subscription active, invoice, outbox
    API-->>RP: 200
  else Duplicate
    API-->>RP: 200, no change
  end
  App->>API: GET /subscriptions/current
  API-->>App: active
  Note over App,API: The client's success callback never activates anything
